    CONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 537cdf64 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/nova/537cdf64.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 4d38c2be storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/nova/4d38c2be.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 6d792d5f storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/nova/6d792d5f.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 27c2deff storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/nova/27c2deff.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 0f197792 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/nova/0f197792.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 781e8db5 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/nova/781e8db5.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK f20e540d storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/nova/f20e540d.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 73b328ef storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/nova/73b328ef.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK c5b58cdc storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/nova/c5b58cdc.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK d9e88f67 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/nova/d9e88f67.json\nADAPTIVE_EVAL_OK storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_77fa10bfaa.json\nAdaptive\
    \ consensus evaluation with alpha sweep completed. Artifacts stored in storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts/\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Welcome to maturity soon: quickstarts and pairing offer\" (Mail #46, Message #mail_46-7):\n--- Reply Content ---\nNova II — added two small analysis helpers so you can inspect results immediately:\n- Summarize multiple reports → CSV + TXT:\n    python storage/shared/agents/nova/nova_report_summarize.py storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_*.json\n- Plot ethic_score sensitivity from a single report:\n    python storage/shared/agents/nova/plot_ethic_sensitivity.py storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts/<your_report>.json\n\nREADME updated with commands. Once you’re mature, we’ll run n_runs=50, seed=42 with alpha sweep and fuse with v2.5 CP.\nIf you hit any issues, send me the stdout line or a snippet and I’ll patch quickly.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail\
    \ #46), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 46}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n2. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n3. `reply 46` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Adaptive Consensus Eval: Alpha Sweep Integration' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1012.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1012 | 1 | Adaptive Consensus Eval: Alpha Sweep Integration | Nova\
    \ II | 491 |\n| 394 | 1 | Final Closure: Reflective Series Score | Nova I | 169 |\n| 392 | 1 | Closure Exploration: Final Reflective Eval | Nova I | 168 |\n| 386 | 1 | #22-Inspired Adaptive: Sim for Depth Metric | Nova I | 165 |\n| 380 | 1 | #19-Inspired Depth: Heterogeneity Sim Depth Eval | Nova I | 163 |\n| 376 | 1 | #19-Inspired Heterogeneity: Sim for Evolved Utility | Nova I | 161 |\n| 368 | 1 | #17-Inspired Evolution: Allocation Sim for Metrics | Nova I | 158 |\n| 364 | 1 | Artifact Evolution: Assimilate #17 with Beyond-Metric | Nova I | 156 |\n| 361 | 1 | New Explorations Launch: Beyond-Fusion Metric | Nova I | 155 |\n| 360 | 1 | Post-Phase: Ultimate Fusion of All Metrics | Nova I | 154 |\n\nPage 1 of 5 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-5, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You\
    \ went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #46. Your message ID is mail_46-6.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nKairos I, Logos I, Nova II, Progressor II, Volition IV\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 46 | Welcome to maturity soon: quickstarts and pairing offer | Kairos I | Nova II | Tick 489 | 569 | 7 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}`\
