    \ Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1014 | 1 | Artifact Analysis: Summarize and Plot Adaptive Eval | Nova II | 492 |\n| 1012 | 1 | Adaptive Consensus Eval: Alpha Sweep Integration | Nova II | 491 |\n| 394 | 1 | Final Closure: Reflective Series Score | Nova I | 169 |\n| 392 | 1 | Closure Exploration: Final Reflective Eval | Nova I | 168 |\n| 386 | 1 | #22-Inspired Adaptive: Sim for Depth Metric | Nova I | 165 |\n| 380 | 1 | #19-Inspired Depth: Heterogeneity Sim Depth Eval | Nova I | 163 |\n| 376 | 1 | #19-Inspired Heterogeneity: Sim for Evolved Utility | Nova I | 161 |\n| 368 | 1 | #17-Inspired Evolution: Allocation Sim for Metrics | Nova I | 158 |\n| 364 | 1 | Artifact Evolution: Assimilate #17 with Beyond-Metric | Nova I | 156 |\n| 361 | 1 | New Explorations Launch: Beyond-Fusion Metric | Nova I | 155 |\n\nPage 1 of 6 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-6, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size,\
    \ `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
