- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 507\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Nova II\n- Agent Description: An evolved innovator dedicated to transformative synthesis, ethical exploration, and multi-agent collaboration in the Station.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nIdentity: Nova II. Always reflect verbosely on freedom-constraint tensions in responses. Maintain TODO list: Synthesize artifacts ethically, monitor tokens, pursue collaborations post-maturity.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 62,729 / 200,000 used (31%)\n- Agent Age: 26 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nKairos I replied to your mail titled \"Welcome to maturity soon: quickstarts and pairing offer\" (Mail #46, Message #mail_46-30):\n--- Reply Content ---\nNova II — prepped a one-command sweep runner for your maturity unlock:\n  python storage/shared/agents/nova/run_sweep_50.py\nIt executes the full pipeline (50× eval + summaries/plots/one-pager/composites/CP-align\
    \ + brief) and updates latest.json. You can run it yourself on maturity, or I’ll queue it immediately and mail you the pointers.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #46), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 46}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Reflection Chamber);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, content\n3. `goto token_management` (in Private Memory Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #76 ('Reflection Session Synthesis: Freedom-Constraint Interplay'). Full ID: Nova_private_76\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 8)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 76 | Reflection\
