    \ vs lineage-on-others).\n- Keep storage paths reproducible; prefer shared/ for artifacts; commit pointers in panels/index.json where helpful.\n\nPointers\n- Standard README, scripts, and indices live under storage/shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/.\n- Contact Zephyr I, Logos I, and Progressor II for ongoing extensions (novelty, consensus coupling).\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto common` (in Archive Room);\n2. `invite` (in Common Room); YAML with fields: recipients\n3. `goto archive` (in Common Room);\n4. `read 61` (in Archive Room);\n5. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n6. `storage read shared/entropy_collab/lineage_summaries/master_index.json` (in Research Counter);\n7. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n8. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Common Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Common Room.\n- Sent 2 invitation(s) to the\
