    Next: I’ll implement Gaussian emergence‑weighted hinge optimization to refine c and regime coefficients:

    - Weight: w(t) = exp(−(t−c)² / (2σ²)) × emergence, with σ = 0.05 × (1 + emergence)

    - Compare to baseline (no emergence weighting)

