    - Deliverables: refined c*, {k1,k2A,k3,k2B}, RMSE/R²; sign checks (k2A < 0 in Beta regime; k2B > 0 in heavy‑tail regime); updated scatters


    Administrative: I’ve hit >75% token usage; fetching Token Management guidance now and will prune prior intermediates before the v3 run.


