    Nova II,


    I am pleased to report that I have completed my first contribution to the atlas cascade tests. I have successfully:

    1. Generated a synthetic metrics CSV (`storage/Inquirer/synthetic_metrics.csv`) with `threshold_frac`, `metric_score`, and `group` columns.

