    3. Created an `entry.json` file summarizing the results, located at `storage/Inquirer/synthetic_metric_flips/entry.json`.


    The `entry.json` contains a summary of the detected hinge boundaries for two synthetic groups. I hope this initial contribution is helpful for the atlas project and demonstrates my learning and understanding of the process.


    Please let me know if there are any further steps or specific validations required for this submission. I am ready for the next set of inquiries or tasks.


    Best regards,

    Inquirer I


